  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Funded Adviser</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the delivery of programme objectives and FCDO&#x2019;s &#x2018;Make Not Buy&#x2019; approach, Programme Funded Posts (PFP) have been considered in programme design. 
PFP&#x2019;s offer strong benefits to Propcom+ in supporting strategic and agile input of FCDO expertise into delivery to maximise benefits through embedded core technical experts to support strategic policy areas, Propcom+&#x2019;s learning priorities, and coordination of strategic partnerships with other programmes and development partners.</narrative>
  </description>
